	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Phrase Shelf

Search and insert snippets from the "Phrase Shelf" macOS app.

## Usage

* snip                       — list categories
* snip &lt;category&gt;            — fuzzy-filter categories, Tab/Return to drill in
* snip &lt;category&gt;#           — list snippets in that category
* snip &lt;category&gt;#&lt;query&gt;    — fuzzy-filter snippets by name

Press Enter on a snippet to copy it and auto-paste it into the frontmost app.

Requires the "Phrase Shelf" app to be installed and running, with Automation
permission granted to this workflow's binary on first use.</string>
